	["The boss is PANICKING! Stress builds super fast. Keep working!!"] = "\194\161El jefe est\195\161 en P\195\129NICO! El estr\195\169s sube s\195\186per r\195\161pido. \194\161\194\161Sigue trabajando!!",
	["He's faster and checks more! Stress builds faster."] = "\194\161Camina m\195\161s r\195\161pido y revisa m\195\161s! El estr\195\169s sube m\195\161s r\195\161pido.",
